---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Modeled on the AiVantEdge Terms of Service, adapted for a Florida construction
// contractor's marketing website. Section 4 (Opt In & SMS Messaging) is required for
// A2P 10DLC carrier registration — keep the STOP/HELP, rates, frequency and
// "does not sell or share mobile information" language.
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Stable Rock Construction LLC"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the Stable Rock Construction LLC website, including quotes, text messages and calls."
  path="/terms"
  active="legal"
>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <p>These Terms of Use (&ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;) set forth the terms that apply when you use the website of Stable Rock Construction LLC (&ldquo;Stable Rock&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;). By using this website you agree to this Agreement.</p>

    <h2>1. About us</h2>
    <p>This website is operated by Stable Rock Construction LLC, a Florida limited liability company based in Miami, Florida, providing roofing, general construction, plumbing, mechanical/HVAC, impact windows and doors, and remodeling services across South Florida and the Florida Keys.</p>

    <h2>2. Use of this site</h2>
    <p>You may use this site to learn about our services and to contact us. You agree not to misuse it, attempt to disrupt it, or use it for any unlawful purpose.</p>

    <h2>3. Enquiries and quotes</h2>
    <p>Information on this site is for general guidance. Nothing here is a binding offer or a guaranteed price. Any quote we give is subject to a site visit and a written agreement.</p>

    <h2>4. Opt in &amp; SMS messaging</h2>
    <p>Providing your information on our contact form gives Stable Rock Construction LLC permission to communicate with you by email or phone to respond to your enquiry and relay information relevant to your project. Separately, we offer an SMS messaging program for customers who voluntarily opt in to receive text messages. You provide consent by selecting an optional, unchecked SMS consent checkbox on the contact form located at stablerockconstruction.com. Providing a phone number alone does not constitute consent &mdash; you must actively select the SMS opt-in checkbox to receive text messages.</p>
    <p>The SMS program includes appointment confirmations, reminders, responses to inquiries, customer support communications, and promotional messages for users who separately agree to receive marketing texts. Message frequency varies based on customer interaction but typically ranges from 1&ndash;4 messages per week. Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier plan.</p>
    <p>You may opt out at any time by replying STOP to any message. For assistance, reply HELP or contact us at abnernu1@stablerockconstruction.com or call (786) 622-7663. Consent to receive SMS messages is not a condition of purchasing any service. Stable Rock Construction LLC does not sell or share mobile information with third parties for marketing purposes. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h2>5. Our content</h2>
    <p>The text, images and logos on this site belong to Stable Rock Construction LLC and may not be copied or reused without our written permission.</p>

    <h2>6. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
    <p>This site is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; without any warranty whatsoever. We do our best to keep it accurate and available but do not guarantee it will always be error-free or uninterrupted.</p>

    <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential or special damages arising from your use of this website.</p>

    <h2>8. Modification</h2>
    <p>We may modify this Agreement from time to time, and such modification is effective upon posting on this page. Your use of the site after any change constitutes acceptance of the updated terms; the current version is always the one on this page.</p>

    <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
    <p>This Agreement is governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules.</p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Stable Rock Construction LLC, serving Miami-Dade County, the Florida Keys and Southwest Florida.<br />
      Phone: <a href="tel:+17866227663">(786) 622-7663</a><br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:abnernu1@stablerockconstruction.com">abnernu1@stablerockconstruction.com</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 74ch; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px 120px; font-family: var(--sr-font-body, system-ui), sans-serif; color: #2e2b26; }
  .legal h1 { font-family: var(--sr-font-serif, Georgia), serif; font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 46px); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .legal h2 { font-family: var(--sr-font-serif, Georgia), serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 38px 0 10px; }
  .legal p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .legal .updated { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #86827a; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .legal a { color: var(--sr-red, #b3261e); }
</style>
